  "description": "The meme perpetuates disability stigma by mocking individuals with physical disabilities for their perceived lack of social engagement or 'obedience.' This stigma is rooted in societal attitudes that view disability as a source of weakness or deviation from the norm, which the meme reinforces through its derogatory language.",
